</div>

	<p>To ensure the vehicle's safety and protection during transport, it is essential to opt for comprehensive insurance coverage. In your case, the 100% declared-value marine transit insurance is highly recommended:</p>
	<h3>100% Declared Value Marine Transit Insurance</h3>
	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Protection against unforeseen circumstances:</strong> This insurance policy provides coverage for the full declared value of the vehicle, ensuring that you receive compensation in case of any accident, damage, or theft during transportation.</span></li>
