		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Regulatory Compliance:</strong> Following the guidelines set by the Indian Bureau of Mines (IBA), this insurance ensures that your transport meets all necessary requirements.</span></li>
	</ul>

	<p>In addition to the essential documents mentioned above, it is advisable to gather the following:</p>
	<h3>Additional Requirements</h3>
	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Original RC (Registration Certificate) copies:</strong> It is necessary to have multiple copies of the original RC for proper documentation during the transportation process.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Vehicle Service Records:</strong> Maintaining a record of the vehicle's service history can prove beneficial for any potential claims during transportation.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Inspection Report:</strong> Obtaining an inspection report from a certified mechanic ensures that the vehicle is in good condition before transportation and can be used for any subsequent claims.</span></li>
	</ul>
	<p>Additionally, it is vital to ensure that the vehicle is in optimal condition before shipping. Ensuring that all necessary repairs and services are carried out is recommended.</p>
	<p>While transporting the vehicle, it is crucial to keep track of all the documentation, including the copies of the original RC, vehicle service records, and the inspection report.</p>
	<p>By having all the required documents and ensuring the vehicle is in good condition, you can have a seamless and stress-free car transportation experience.</p>
